Spec: SpecDD Symbol Reference

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Resolve backticked SpecDD code candidates to IntelliJ PSI symbols when possible.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDSymbolReference.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDSymbolReference.kt

Can read:
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/SpecDDSymbolReferenceBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Keep symbol references soft.
  Resolve only explicit backticked code candidates supplied by the reference provider.
  Resolve symbol text through IntelliJ registered name contributors when available.
  Resolve dotted candidates by also querying the final symbol segment with the full dotted text as the contributor pattern.
  Return all valid PSI results up to a maximum of 50 targets so IntelliJ can present ambiguous choices.
  Return no target for unresolved symbol candidates.
  Ignore explicit file path candidates because they are handled by path references.
  Avoid compile-time dependencies on language-specific plugins.

Must not:
  Link plain prose.
  Report diagnostics.
  Add unresolved-symbol warnings.
